    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i was thinking about the CNS side of things too. how does a deload actually help with systemic fatigue specifically? like why does resting the nervous system help the actual muscle fiber recruitment during the next heavy cycle?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
